              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2018-9138\nSeverity: low\nPackage: libbinutils\nVersion: 2.31.1-16\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /usr/share/doc/libbinutils/copyright\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2018-9138](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2018-9138)",
