              "id": "CVE-2019-17451-binutils",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2019-17451 low vulnerability for binutils package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An issue was discovered in the Binary File Descriptor (BFD) library (aka libbfd), as distributed in GNU Binutils 2.32. It is an integer overflow leading to a SEGV in _bfd_dwarf2_find_nearest_line in dwarf2.c, as demonstrated by nm."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2019-17451\nSeverity: low\nPackage: binutils\nVersion: 2.31.1-16\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /usr/share/doc/binutils/copyright\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2019-17451](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2019-17451)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2019-17451**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| low  | binutils  | 2.31.1-16  |   | deb  | /usr/share/doc/binutils/copyright  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2019-17451](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2019-17451)  |\n"
