              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  f2fs: fix to avoid potential deadlock  Using f2fs_trylock_op() in f2fs_write_compressed_pages() to avoid potential deadlock like we did in f2fs_write_single_data_page()."
