                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2021-23336**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | libpython3.7-stdlib  | 3.7.3-2+deb10u5  |   | deb  | /usr/share/doc/libpython3.7-stdlib/copyright  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2021-23336](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2021-23336)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
