              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  ext4: fix memory leak in ext4_mb_init_backend on error path.  Fix a memory leak discovered by syzbot when a file system is corrupted with an illegally large s_log_groups_per_flex."
