              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  scsi: pm80xx: Fix memory leak during rmmod  Driver failed to release all memory allocated. This would lead to memory leak during driver removal.  Properly free memory when the module is removed."
              },
