              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  net: dpaa2-eth: fix use-after-free in dpaa2_eth_remove  Access to netdev after free_netdev() will cause use-after-free bug. Move debug log before free_netdev() call to avoid it."
              },
