              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  ALSA: usb-audio: fix null pointer dereference on pointer cs_desc  The pointer cs_desc return from snd_usb_find_clock_source could be null, so there is a potential null pointer dereference issue. Fix this by adding a null check before dereference."
              },
