              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  cifs: prevent NULL deref in cifs_compose_mount_options()  The optional @ref parameter might contain an NULL node_name, so prevent dereferencing it in cifs_compose_mount_options().  Addresses-Coverity: 1476408 (\"Explicit null dereferenced\")"
