              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  scsi: megaraid_sas: Fix resource leak in case of probe failure  The driver doesn't clean up all the allocated resources properly when scsi_add_host(), megasas_start_aen() function fails during the PCI device probe.  Clean up all those resources."
