              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  ALSA: usx2y: Don't call free_pages_exact() with NULL address  Unlike some other functions, we can't pass NULL pointer to free_pages_exact().  Add a proper NULL check for avoiding possible Oops."
