            {
              "id": "CVE-2021-47410-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2021-47410 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  drm/amdkfd: fix svm_migrate_fini warning  Device manager releases device-specific resources when a driver disconnects from a device, devm_memunmap_pages and devm_release_mem_region calls in svm_migrate_fini are redundant.  It causes below warning trace after patch \"drm/amdgpu: Split amdgpu_device_fini into early and late\", so remove function svm_migrate_fini.  BUG: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/drm/amd/-/issues/1718  WARNING: CPU: 1 PID: 3646 at drivers/base/devres.c:795 devm_release_action+0x51/0x60 Call Trace:     ? memunmap_pages+0x360/0x360     svm_migrate_fini+0x2d/0x60 [amdgpu]     kgd2kfd_device_exit+0x23/0xa0 [amdgpu]     amdgpu_amdkfd_device_fini_sw+0x1d/0x30 [amdgpu]     amdgpu_device_fini_sw+0x45/0x290 [amdgpu]     amdgpu_driver_release_kms+0x12/0x30 [amdgpu]     drm_dev_release+0x20/0x40 [drm]     release_nodes+0x196/0x1e0     device_release_driver_internal+0x104/0x1d0     driver_detach+0x47/0x90     bus_remove_driver+0x7a/0xd0     pci_unregister_driver+0x3d/0x90     amdgpu_exit+0x11/0x20 [amdgpu]"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2021-47410\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nVersion: 4.19.289-2\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2021-47410](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2021-47410)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2021-47410**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | linux-libc-dev  | 4.19.289-2  |   | deb  | /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2021-47410](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2021-47410)  |\n"
              },
