            {
              "id": "CVE-2021-47455-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2021-47455 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  ptp: Fix possible memory leak in ptp_clock_register()  I got memory leak as follows when doing fault injection test:  unreferenced object 0xffff88800906c618 (size 8):   comm \"i2c-idt82p33931\", pid 4421, jiffies 4294948083 (age 13.188s)   hex dump (first 8 bytes):     70 74 70 30 00 00 00 00                          ptp0....   backtrace:     [\u003c00000000312ed458\u003e] __kmalloc_track_caller+0x19f/0x3a0     [\u003c0000000079f6e2ff\u003e] kvasprintf+0xb5/0x150     [\u003c0000000026aae54f\u003e] kvasprintf_const+0x60/0x190     [\u003c00000000f323a5f7\u003e] kobject_set_name_vargs+0x56/0x150     [\u003c000000004e35abdd\u003e] dev_set_name+0xc0/0x100     [\u003c00000000f20cfe25\u003e] ptp_clock_register+0x9f4/0xd30 [ptp]     [\u003c000000008bb9f0de\u003e] idt82p33_probe.cold+0x8b6/0x1561 [ptp_idt82p33]  When posix_clock_register() returns an error, the name allocated in dev_set_name() will be leaked, the put_device() should be used to give up the device reference, then the name will be freed in kobject_cleanup() and other memory will be freed in ptp_clock_release()."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2021-47455\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nVersion: 4.19.289-2\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2021-47455](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2021-47455)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2021-47455**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | linux-libc-dev  | 4.19.289-2  |   | deb  | /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2021-47455](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2021-47455)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
