                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2021-47578\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nVersion: 4.19.289-2\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2021-47578](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2021-47578)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2021-47578**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | linux-libc-dev  | 4.19.289-2  |   | deb  | /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2021-47578](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2021-47578)  |\n"
