              "id": "CVE-2022-1247-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2022-1247 low vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An issue found in linux-kernel that leads to a race condition in rose_connect(). The rose driver uses rose_neigh-\u003euse to represent how many objects are using the rose_neigh. When a user wants to delete a rose_route via rose_ioctl(), the rose driver calls rose_del_node() and removes neighbours only if their “count” and “use” are zero."
              },
