              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  vdpa: ifcvf: Do proper cleanup if IFCVF init fails  ifcvf_mgmt_dev leaks memory if it is not freed before returning. Call is made to correct return statement so memory does not leak. ifcvf_init_hw does not take care of this so it is needed to do it here."
