                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2023-28321**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | libcurl4  | 7.64.0-4+deb10u6  | 7.64.0-4+deb10u7  | deb  | /usr/share/doc/libcurl4/copyright  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2023-28321](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2023-28321)  |\n"
              },
