              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  ksmbd: fix race condition between session lookup and expire   Thread A                        +  Thread B  ksmbd_session_lookup            |  smb2_sess_setup    sess = xa_load                |                                  |                                  |    xa_erase(\u0026conn-\u003esessions, sess-\u003eid);                                  |                                  |    ksmbd_session_destroy(sess) --\u003e kfree(sess)                                  |    // UAF!                       |    sess-\u003elast_active = jiffies   |                                  +  This patch add rwsem to fix race condition between ksmbd_session_lookup and ksmbd_expire_session."
