            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-52600-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-52600 high vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  jfs: fix uaf in jfs_evict_inode  When the execution of diMount(ipimap) fails, the object ipimap that has been released may be accessed in diFreeSpecial(). Asynchronous ipimap release occurs when rcu_core() calls jfs_free_node().  Therefore, when diMount(ipimap) fails, sbi-\u003eipimap should not be initialized as ipimap."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
