              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  drm/tegra: dsi: Add missing check for of_find_device_by_node  Add check for the return value of of_find_device_by_node() and return the error if it fails in order to avoid NULL pointer dereference."
