                "text": "CVE-2023-52671 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  drm/amd/display: Fix hang/underflow when transitioning to ODM4:1  [Why] Under some circumstances, disabling an OPTC and attempting to reclaim its OPP(s) for a different OPTC could cause a hang/underflow due to OPPs not being properly disconnected from the disabled OPTC.  [How] Ensure that all OPPs are unassigned from an OPTC when it gets disabled."
              },
