            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-52683-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-52683 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  ACPI: LPIT: Avoid u32 multiplication overflow  In lpit_update_residency() there is a possibility of overflow in multiplication, if tsc_khz is large enough (\u003e UINT_MAX/1000).  Change multiplication to mul_u32_u32().  Found by Linux Verification Center (linuxtesting.org) with SVACE."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
