            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-52766-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-52766 high vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  i3c: mipi-i3c-hci: Fix out of bounds access in hci_dma_irq_handler  Do not loop over ring headers in hci_dma_irq_handler() that are not allocated and enabled in hci_dma_init(). Otherwise out of bounds access will occur from rings-\u003eheaders[i] access when i \u003e= number of allocated ring headers."
              },
