                "text": "CVE-2023-52812 high vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  drm/amd: check num of link levels when update pcie param  In SR-IOV environment, the value of pcie_table-\u003enum_of_link_levels will be 0, and num_of_levels - 1 will cause array index out of bounds"
