                "text": "CVE-2023-52825 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  drm/amdkfd: Fix a race condition of vram buffer unref in svm code  prange-\u003esvm_bo unref can happen in both mmu callback and a callback after migrate to system ram. Both are async call in different tasks. Sync svm_bo unref operation to avoid random \"use-after-free\"."
