            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-52840-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-52840 high vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  Input: synaptics-rmi4 - fix use after free in rmi_unregister_function()  The put_device() calls rmi_release_function() which frees \"fn\" so the dereference on the next line \"fn-\u003enum_of_irqs\" is a use after free. Move the put_device() to the end to fix this."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2023-52840\nSeverity: high\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nVersion: 4.19.289-2\nFix Version: 4.19.304-1\nType: deb\nLocation: /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2023-52840](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2023-52840)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2023-52840**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | linux-libc-dev  | 4.19.289-2  | 4.19.304-1  | deb  | /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2023-52840](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2023-52840)  |\n"
