              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  tty: n_gsm: require CAP_NET_ADMIN to attach N_GSM0710 ldisc  Any unprivileged user can attach N_GSM0710 ldisc, but it requires CAP_NET_ADMIN to create a GSM network anyway.  Require initial namespace CAP_NET_ADMIN to do that."
