            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-26640-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-26640 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  tcp: add sanity checks to rx zerocopy  TCP rx zerocopy intent is to map pages initially allocated from NIC drivers, not pages owned by a fs.  This patch adds to can_map_frag() these additional checks:  - Page must not be a compound one. - page-\u003emapping must be NULL.  This fixes the panic reported by ZhangPeng.  syzbot was able to loopback packets built with sendfile(), mapping pages owned by an ext4 file to TCP rx zerocopy.  r3 = socket$inet_tcp(0x2, 0x1, 0x0) mmap(\u0026(0x7f0000ff9000/0x4000)=nil, 0x4000, 0x0, 0x12, r3, 0x0) r4 = socket$inet_tcp(0x2, 0x1, 0x0) bind$inet(r4, \u0026(0x7f0000000000)={0x2, 0x4e24, @multicast1}, 0x10) connect$inet(r4, \u0026(0x7f00000006c0)={0x2, 0x4e24, @empty}, 0x10) r5 = openat$dir(0xffffffffffffff9c, \u0026(0x7f00000000c0)='./file0\\x00',     0x181e42, 0x0) fallocate(r5, 0x0, 0x0, 0x85b8) sendfile(r4, r5, 0x0, 0x8ba0) getsockopt$inet_tcp_TCP_ZEROCOPY_RECEIVE(r4, 0x6, 0x23,     \u0026(0x7f00000001c0)={\u0026(0x7f0000ffb000/0x3000)=nil, 0x3000, 0x0, 0x0, 0x0,     0x0, 0x0, 0x0, 0x0}, \u0026(0x7f0000000440)=0x40) r6 = openat$dir(0xffffffffffffff9c, \u0026(0x7f00000000c0)='./file0\\x00',     0x181e42, 0x0)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-26640\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nVersion: 4.19.289-2\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2024-26640](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-26640)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-26640**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | linux-libc-dev  | 4.19.289-2  |   | deb  | /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2024-26640](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-26640)  |\n"
              },
