            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-26648-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-26648 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  drm/amd/display: Fix variable deferencing before NULL check in edp_setup_replay()  In edp_setup_replay(), 'struct dc *dc' \u0026 'struct dmub_replay *replay' was dereferenced before the pointer 'link' \u0026 'replay' NULL check.  Fixes the below: drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/../display/dc/link/protocols/link_edp_panel_control.c:947 edp_setup_replay() warn: variable dereferenced before check 'link' (see line 933)"
              },
