                "text": "CVE-2024-26668 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  netfilter: nft_limit: reject configurations that cause integer overflow  Reject bogus configs where internal token counter wraps around. This only occurs with very very large requests, such as 17gbyte/s.  Its better to reject this rather than having incorrect ratelimit."
