            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-26679-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-26679 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  inet: read sk-\u003esk_family once in inet_recv_error()  inet_recv_error() is called without holding the socket lock.  IPv6 socket could mutate to IPv4 with IPV6_ADDRFORM socket option and trigger a KCSAN warning."
              },
