              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-26719-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-26719 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  nouveau: offload fence uevents work to workqueue  This should break the deadlock between the fctx lock and the irq lock.  This offloads the processing off the work from the irq into a workqueue."
