            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-26840-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-26840 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  cachefiles: fix memory leak in cachefiles_add_cache()  The following memory leak was reported after unbinding /dev/cachefiles:  ================================================================== unreferenced object 0xffff9b674176e3c0 (size 192):   comm \"cachefilesd2\", pid 680, jiffies 4294881224   hex dump (first 32 bytes):     01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  ................     00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  ................   backtrace (crc ea38a44b):     [\u003cffffffff8eb8a1a5\u003e] kmem_cache_alloc+0x2d5/0x370     [\u003cffffffff8e917f86\u003e] prepare_creds+0x26/0x2e0     [\u003cffffffffc002eeef\u003e] cachefiles_determine_cache_security+0x1f/0x120     [\u003cffffffffc00243ec\u003e] cachefiles_add_cache+0x13c/0x3a0     [\u003cffffffffc0025216\u003e] cachefiles_daemon_write+0x146/0x1c0     [\u003cffffffff8ebc4a3b\u003e] vfs_write+0xcb/0x520     [\u003cffffffff8ebc5069\u003e] ksys_write+0x69/0xf0     [\u003cffffffff8f6d4662\u003e] do_syscall_64+0x72/0x140     [\u003cffffffff8f8000aa\u003e] entry_SYSCALL_64_after_hwframe+0x6e/0x76 ==================================================================  Put the reference count of cache_cred in cachefiles_daemon_unbind() to fix the problem. And also put cache_cred in cachefiles_add_cache() error branch to avoid memory leaks."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-26840\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nVersion: 4.19.289-2\nFix Version: 4.19.316-1\nType: deb\nLocation: /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2024-26840](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-26840)",
