            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-26878-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-26878 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  quota: Fix potential NULL pointer dereference  Below race may cause NULL pointer dereference  P1\t\t\t\t\tP2 dquot_free_inode\t\t\tquota_off \t\t\t\t\t  drop_dquot_ref \t\t\t\t\t   remove_dquot_ref \t\t\t\t\t   dquots = i_dquot(inode)   dquots = i_dquot(inode)   srcu_read_lock   dquots[cnt]) != NULL (1) \t\t\t\t\t     dquots[type] = NULL (2)   spin_lock(\u0026dquots[cnt]-\u003edq_dqb_lock) (3)    ....  If dquot_free_inode(or other routines) checks inode's quota pointers (1) before quota_off sets it to NULL(2) and use it (3) after that, NULL pointer dereference will be triggered.  So let's fix it by using a temporary pointer to avoid this issue."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-26878\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nVersion: 4.19.289-2\nFix Version: 4.19.316-1\nType: deb\nLocation: /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2024-26878](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-26878)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-26878**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | linux-libc-dev  | 4.19.289-2  | 4.19.316-1  | deb  | /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2024-26878](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-26878)  |\n"
              },
