              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  scsi: qla2xxx: Fix double free of the ha-\u003evp_map pointer  Coverity scan reported potential risk of double free of the pointer ha-\u003evp_map.  ha-\u003evp_map was freed in qla2x00_mem_alloc(), and again freed in function qla2x00_mem_free(ha).  Assign NULL to vp_map and kfree take care of NULL."
