            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-27051-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-27051 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  cpufreq: brcmstb-avs-cpufreq: add check for cpufreq_cpu_get's return value  cpufreq_cpu_get may return NULL. To avoid NULL-dereference check it and return 0 in case of error.  Found by Linux Verification Center (linuxtesting.org) with SVACE."
