                "text": "CVE-2024-27388 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  SUNRPC: fix some memleaks in gssx_dec_option_array  The creds and oa-\u003edata need to be freed in the error-handling paths after their allocation. So this patch add these deallocations in the corresponding paths."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
