              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  dm snapshot: fix lockup in dm_exception_table_exit  There was reported lockup when we exit a snapshot with many exceptions. Fix this by adding \"cond_resched\" to the loop that frees the exceptions."
