            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-35869-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-35869 high vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  smb: client: guarantee refcounted children from parent session  Avoid potential use-after-free bugs when walking DFS referrals, mounting and performing DFS failover by ensuring that all children from parent @tcon-\u003eses are also refcounted.  They're all needed across the entire DFS mount.  Get rid of @tcon-\u003edfs_ses_list while we're at it, too."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
