            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-36015-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-36015 high vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  ppdev: Add an error check in register_device  In register_device, the return value of ida_simple_get is unchecked, in witch ida_simple_get will use an invalid index value.  To address this issue, index should be checked after ida_simple_get. When the index value is abnormal, a warning message should be printed, the port should be dropped, and the value should be recorded."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-36015\nSeverity: high\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nVersion: 4.19.289-2\nFix Version: 4.19.316-1\nType: deb\nLocation: /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2024-36015](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-36015)",
