              "id": "CVE-2024-36288-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-36288 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  SUNRPC: Fix loop termination condition in gss_free_in_token_pages()  The in_token-\u003epages[] array is not NULL terminated. This results in the following KASAN splat:    KASAN: maybe wild-memory-access in range [0x04a2013400000008-0x04a201340000000f]"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
