              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  Bluetooth: qca: add missing firmware sanity checks  Add the missing sanity checks when parsing the firmware files before downloading them to avoid accessing and corrupting memory beyond the vmalloced buffer."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
