            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-36903-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-36903 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  ipv6: Fix potential uninit-value access in __ip6_make_skb()  As it was done in commit fc1092f51567 (\"ipv4: Fix uninit-value access in __ip_make_skb()\") for IPv4, check FLOWI_FLAG_KNOWN_NH on fl6-\u003eflowi6_flags instead of testing HDRINCL on the socket to avoid a race condition which causes uninit-value access."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
