                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-36911**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | linux-libc-dev  | 4.19.289-2  |   | deb  | /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2024-36911](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-36911)  |\n"
