            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-36946-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-36946 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  phonet: fix rtm_phonet_notify() skb allocation  fill_route() stores three components in the skb:  - struct rtmsg - RTA_DST (u8) - RTA_OIF (u32)  Therefore, rtm_phonet_notify() should use  NLMSG_ALIGN(sizeof(struct rtmsg)) + nla_total_size(1) + nla_total_size(4)"
              },
