            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-38381-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-38381 high vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  nfc: nci: Fix uninit-value in nci_rx_work  syzbot reported the following uninit-value access issue [1]  nci_rx_work() parses received packet from ndev-\u003erx_q. It should be validated header size, payload size and total packet size before processing the packet. If an invalid packet is detected, it should be silently discarded."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
