            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-38547-linux-libc-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-38547 medium vulnerability for linux-libc-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  media: atomisp: ssh_css: Fix a null-pointer dereference in load_video_binaries  The allocation failure of mycs-\u003eyuv_scaler_binary in load_video_binaries() is followed with a dereference of mycs-\u003eyuv_scaler_binary after the following call chain:  sh_css_pipe_load_binaries()   |-\u003e load_video_binaries(mycs-\u003eyuv_scaler_binary == NULL)   |   |-\u003e sh_css_pipe_unload_binaries()         |-\u003e unload_video_binaries()  In unload_video_binaries(), it calls to ia_css_binary_unload with argument \u0026pipe-\u003epipe_settings.video.yuv_scaler_binary[i], which refers to the same memory slot as mycs-\u003eyuv_scaler_binary. Thus, a null-pointer dereference is triggered."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-38547\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nVersion: 4.19.289-2\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2024-38547](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-38547)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-38547**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | linux-libc-dev  | 4.19.289-2  |   | deb  | /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2024-38547](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-38547)  |\n"
