                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-38627\nSeverity: high\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nVersion: 4.19.289-2\nFix Version: 4.19.316-1\nType: deb\nLocation: /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2024-38627](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-38627)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-38627**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | linux-libc-dev  | 4.19.289-2  | 4.19.316-1  | deb  | /usr/share/doc/linux-libc-dev/copyright  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2024-38627](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-38627)  |\n"
              },
